Output demo/demo.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1240
Set Height 590
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 110ms

Hide
Type "bash demo/sessions.sh /tmp/demo && export LANG=C.UTF-8 HOME=/home/demo CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=/tmp/demo PATH=$PWD:$PATH PS1='$ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Sleep 500ms
Type "claude-resume"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms

Down
Sleep 1600ms
Down
Sleep 1600ms

Type "shop"
Sleep 1500ms
Down
Sleep 1800ms

Ctrl+U
Sleep 500ms
Type "weekly"
Sleep 1500ms
Ctrl+D
Sleep 2500ms
Right
Sleep 1200ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms

Ctrl+U
Sleep 3000ms
